			</heading>
			<begin-paragraph>
			</begin-paragraph>
			<v n="1">And Job again<crossref let="r" cid="c18027001.1" />took up his discourse , and said :</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18027002">
			</marker>
			<v n="2">and the Almighty , who has<crossref let="t" cid="c18027002.2" />made my soul bitter ,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18027003">
			</marker>
			<v n="3">and<crossref let="u" cid="c18027003.1" />the spirit of God is in my nostrils ,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18027004">
			</marker>
			<v n="4">and my tongue will not utter<crossref let="v" cid="c18027004.1" />deceit .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18027005">
			</marker>
			<v n="5">till I die I will not put away my<crossref let="w" cid="c18027005.1" />integrity from me .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18027006">
			</marker>
			<v n="6">my heart does not<crossref let="y" cid="c18027006.2" />reproach me for any of my days .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18027007">
			</marker>
			<v n="7">and let him who rises up against me be as the unrighteous .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18027008">
			</marker>
			<v n="8">when God takes away his life ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18027009">
			</marker>
			<v n="9">when distress comes upon him ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18027010">
			</marker>
			<v n="10">Will he call upon God at all times ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18027011">
			</marker>
			<v n="11">
				<crossref let="d" cid="c18027011.1" />what is with the Almighty I will not conceal .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18027012">
			</marker>
			<v n="12">why then have you become altogether vain ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18027013">
			</marker>
			<v n="13">and the heritage that<crossref let="f" cid="c18027013.2" />oppressors receive from the Almighty :</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18027014">
			</marker>
			<v n="14">and his descendants have not enough bread .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18027015">
			</marker>
			<v n="15">and his<crossref let="i" cid="c18027015.1" />widows do not weep .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18027016">
			</marker>
			<v n="16">and pile up clothing like clay ,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18027017">
			</marker>
			<v n="17">and<crossref let="k" cid="c18027017.1" />the innocent will divide the silver .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18027018">
			</marker>
			<v n="18">like<crossref let="m" cid="c18027018.2" />a booth that<crossref let="n" cid="c18027018.3" />a watchman makes .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18027019">
			</marker>
			<v n="19">he opens his eyes , and<crossref let="p" cid="c18027019.2" />his wealth is gone .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18027020">
			</marker>
			<v n="20">in the night a whirlwind<crossref let="s" cid="c18027020.3" />carries him off .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18027021">
			</marker>
			<v n="21">it<crossref let="u" cid="c18027021.2" />sweeps him out of his place .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18027022">
			</marker>
			<v n="22">he flees from its power in headlong flight .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18027023">
			</marker>
			<v n="23">and<crossref let="x" cid="c18027023.2" />hisses at him from its place .</v>
